# Normalize line endings to LF in the repo and on checkout for ALL platforms.
#
# Why: GitHub's Windows CI runners default to `core.autocrlf=true`, which
# rewrites text files to CRLF on checkout. vite-node's transform of a shebang'd
# `.mjs` (e.g. scripts/update-puppeteer.mjs) throws
# `SyntaxError: Invalid or unexpected token` when the source has CRLF endings,
# so the unit suite failed on Windows CI but passed on LF dev boxes. Forcing LF
# makes the working tree identical across OSes and removes the whole class of
# CRLF-induced parse/transform bugs. (BUG-020)

* text=auto eol=lf

# Explicit text types (belt-and-suspenders; covered by text=auto above).
*.ts   text eol=lf
*.tsx  text eol=lf
*.js   text eol=lf
*.mjs  text eol=lf
*.cjs  text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.md   text eol=lf
*.yml  text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf

# Binary assets must never be line-ending normalized.
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif  binary
*.ico  binary
*.pdf  binary
*.woff  binary
*.woff2 binary
